simslim — https://github.com/MobAI-App/simslim

Used for the launchd work behind slim slots and `reap --scrub`: reading
and writing a simulator's launchd disable overrides, and measuring and
deleting a simulator's regenerable on-disk data. See the README's "Slim
slots" section.

